From c14f406bfca9d4915231e3d11560e125572ec4a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: User-3090 <71881005+User-3090@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 07:35:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/27] feat(windows): preserve terminal appearance

Transport bounded host color and appearance events, keep software and native cursors visible with host and child-selected colors, and follow host appearance for otherwise unconfigured themes.

Refs herdrdev/herdr#2786
